(
    title: "Pachinko",
    description: Some("Work the handle to set launch strength and feed balls into a pachinko table, starting from a tray of fifty. Pockets spin a central digital slot whose combination decides how long the lucky gate stays open — three sevens hold it thirty seconds, and a ball into the open gate\'s centre buys thirty more, up to ten times. Reaching three thousand balls plays the machine out."),
